  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Net magnetic moment of the system is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Here currents in both circular loops are in opposite direction)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
